[ti:Adāsi me akāsi me – Anumodana]
[place:Amaravati Monastery]
[source:https://amaravati.org/audio/adasi-me-akasi-me-anumodana/]
# The title is taken from the source page's address and is not confirmed.
# Converted from the previous site's marker file just-as-rivers-markers-amaravati.json,
# where the three chants were one chant, "Just as rivers".
# Chants in recording order:
#   yatha-vari-vaha-pura, lines 1-15
#   adasi-me-adi-gatha
#   yatha-vari-vaha-pura, lines 16-27, the same stretch as bhavatu-sabba-mangalam
#   bhavatu-sabba-mangalam

[chant:0101 yatha-vari-vaha-pura]
[00:00.00]1 Yathā vāri-vahā pūrā paripūrenti sāgaraṁ
[00:08.38]2 Evam-eva ito dinnaṁ petānaṁ upakappati
[00:14.99]3 Icchitaṁ patthitaṁ tumhaṁ
[00:16.75]4 Khippam-eva samijjhatu
[00:19.35]5 Sabbe pūrentu saṅkappā
[00:21.78]6 Cando paṇṇaraso yathā
[00:24.71]7 Maṇi jotiraso yathā
[00:28.35]8 Sabb'ītiyo vivajjantu
[00:32.60]9 Sabba-rogo vinassatu
[00:38.17]10 Mā te bhavatv-antarāyo
[00:43.59]11 Sukhī dīgh'āyuko bhava
[00:47.20]12 Abhivādana-sīlissa
[00:50.28]13 Niccaṁ vuḍḍhāpacāyino
[00:53.53]14 Cattāro dhammā vaḍḍhanti
[00:57.97]15 Āyu vaṇṇo sukhaṁ balaṁ

[chant:0105 adasi-me-adi-gatha]
[01:04.54]1 Adāsi me akāsi me
[01:07.63]2 ñāti-mittā sakhā ca me
[01:11.54]3 Petānaṁ dakkhiṇaṁ dajjā
[01:14.87]4 pubbe katam-anussaraṁ
[01:17.59]5 Na hi ruṇṇaṁ vā soko vā
[01:21.00]6 yā v'aññā paridevanā
[01:23.82]7 Na taṁ petānam-atthāya
[01:27.76]8 evaṁ tiṭṭhanti ñātayo
[01:30.10]9 Ayañ-ca kho dakkhiṇā dinnā
[01:33.88]10 Saṅghamhi supatiṭṭhitā
[01:36.85]11 Dīgha-rattaṁ hitāy'assa
[01:39.82]12 Ṭhānaso upakappati
[01:43.02]13 So ñāti-dhammo ca ayaṁ nidassito
[01:47.54]14 Petāna'pūjā ca katā uḷārā
[01:51.80]15 Balañ-ca bhikkhūnam-anuppadinnaṁ
[01:55.90]16 Tumhehi puññaṁ pasutaṁ anappakan'ti.

[chant:0101 yatha-vari-vaha-pura]
[02:00.90]16 Bhavatu sabba-maṅgalaṁ
[02:04.16]17 Rakkhantu sabba-devatā
[02:07.82]18 Sabba-buddhānubhāvena
[02:11.96]19 Sadā sotthī bhavantu te
[02:15.32]20 Bhavatu sabba-maṅgalaṁ
[02:18.77]21 Rakkhantu sabba-devatā
[02:21.98]22 Sabba-dhammānubhāvena
[02:26.12]23 Sadā sotthī bhavantu te
[02:29.53]24 Bhavatu sabba-maṅgalaṁ
[02:33.10]25 Rakkhantu sabba-devatā
[02:36.72]26 Sabba-saṅghānubhāvena
[02:41.46]27 Sadā sotthī bhavantu te

[chant:0071 bhavatu-sabba-mangalam]
[02:00.90]1 Bhavatu sabba-maṅgalaṁ rakkhantu sabba-devatā
[02:07.82]2 Sabba-buddhānubhāvena sadā sotthī bhavantu te
[02:15.32]3 Bhavatu sabba-maṅgalaṁ rakkhantu sabba-devatā
[02:21.98]4 Sabba-dhammānubhāvena sadā sotthī bhavantu te
[02:29.53]5 Bhavatu sabba-maṅgalaṁ rakkhantu sabba-devatā
[02:36.72]6 Sabba-saṅghānubhāvena sadā sotthī bhavantu te
